s lol. It was super awesome, and they even made food and brought it to the =
church! I did think I was gonna wither away by the end though, way too long=
 of a lesson bro =F0=9F=98=B5 It&#39;s sad to say goodbye to probably the t=
wo closest friends in the area, but I know I&#39;ll see them again =F0=9F=
=98=84=F0=9F=98=84 I hope they are doing well when I come back =F0=9F=98=81=
=F0=9F=98=81 They made (unknowningly) like one of my favorite desserts call=
ed =E2=80=9Cfrog eye salad=E2=80=9D. It low key had some different ingredie=
nts and probably isn&#39;t frog eye salad technically it is in my eyes and =
I was so happy to eat it =F0=9F=98=82=E2=9D=A4</div><div dir=3D"auto"><br><=
/div><div dir=3D"auto">Sunday</div><div dir=3D"auto">Said goodbye to member=
s at church =F0=9F=98=A2 Ikawa Kyoudai made some peanut butter chocolate ch=
ip cookies and gave me a candy Lei as per tradition in Ibaraki Ward. I also=
 got a big signed note from a bunch of members which was really sweet =F0=
=9F=98=8A When I left the church building Shingo Kyoudai gave me a very tea=
rfully farewell =F0=9F=98=85 Hope bro will be alright without me to talk to=
 during the activities =F0=9F=99=8F Afterwards we went Shopping for groceri=
es with Yu Kyoudai ON SUNDAY WHAT =F0=9F=9A=A8 He wanted us to come over an=
d eat some food but didn&#39;t know what we&#39;d like so just said we coul=
d come with him shopping to decide. Hopefully we won&#39;t do that in the f=
uture lol. At his place we had some super tasty Korean food, and taught a l=
esson to him and his mom. Apparently he didn&#39;t know that his dad can st=
ill make it to heaven even though he died not a member of the church. It&#3=
9;s insane that nobody ever taught him about that, he is a member, so like =
whaaaattt =F0=9F=98=82 anyways I&#39;m glad we got that cleared up with him=
. We got to look at his Mercedes Benz before we said goodbye which was awes=
ome. He&#39;s got one of his books of Mormon on the center console in there=
, for all to see =F0=9F=98=82=F0=9F=98=84 We love that.=C2=A0</div><div dir=
=3D"auto"><br></div><div dir=3D"auto">Monday</div><div dir=3D"auto">Said hi=
 to Potts=E9=95=B7=E8=80=81 and Wheeler=E9=95=B7=E8=80=81, was so awesome t=
o see them after so long! Met with my new comp!! =F0=9F=9A=A8=F0=9F=9A=A8=
=F0=9F=9A=A8 His name is Mackay=E9=95=B7=E8=80=81 and he&#39;s got some cra=
zy energy. =E2=80=9CLock in.=E2=80=9D</div><div dir=3D"auto">We rode a 4 ho=
ur bus to Shikoku and walked to our apartment. Did some unpacking and that&=
#39;s about it, crazy to be in a new apartment =F0=9F=98=85=F0=9F=98=84</di=
v><div dir=3D"auto"><br></div><div dir=3D"auto">Tuesday</div><div dir=3D"au=
to">Today Was my first full day with Mackay=E9=95=B7=E8=80=81, and it was w=
ay less eventful Than I&#39;d expected. Apparently even an area like Maruga=
me is much more country than Ibaraki lol. We are gonna have a lot more time=
 for finding. Today we helped pack up Mackay=E9=95=B7=E8=80=81=E2=80=99s pa=
